sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as Trails Frontend
    participant Controller as TestExecutionController
    participant Facade as TestExecutionFacadeService
    participant TestService
    participant EventHub as TestExecutionEventHub
    participant DB as Test Data/Result Persistence
    participant Grid as Selenium Grid
    participant Browser as Browser Node
    participant Target as Application Under Test

    User->>Frontend: Start test run
    Frontend->>Controller: POST /api/test
    Controller->>Controller: Validate and map run definition
    Controller->>Facade: executeTest(executionId, runDefinition)
    Facade->>TestService: runTest(callbacks)
    TestService-->>Controller: Accepted immediately
    Controller-->>Frontend: 202 Accepted with executionId and event link
    Frontend->>Controller: GET /api/test/events/{executionId}
    Controller->>EventHub: subscribe(executionId)
    EventHub-->>Frontend: SSE stream
    TestService->>EventHub: publish test.started
    TestService->>DB: Load executable test plan and related data
    TestService->>Grid: Create remote browser sessions
    Grid->>Browser: Assign browser nodes
    TestService->>Browser: Execute arranged test sets and actions
    Browser->>Target: Operate web application
    Target-->>Browser: Pages, responses, downloads
    Browser-->>TestService: Action results and artifacts
    TestService->>DB: Store test run result
    DB-->>TestService: Persisted test run result
    TestService->>EventHub: publish test.completed
    EventHub-->>Frontend: Terminal event
    Frontend-->>User: Show completed result
